%% alt: Reciprocal Rank Fusion. A query goes to keyword search, which ranks D3, D1, D7, and to vector search, which ranks D1, D5, D3. Each document scores the sum of one over sixty plus its rank in each list, giving the fused order D1, D3, D5, D7.
flowchart LR
  Q[Query]:::human --> KW[Keyword search<br/>1 D3 · 2 D1 · 3 D7]:::tool
  Q --> VS[Vector search<br/>1 D1 · 2 D5 · 3 D3]:::tool
  KW --> F["Score = sum over lists<br/>of 1 / (60 + rank)"]:::control
  VS --> F
  F --> O[Fused order<br/>D1 · D3 · D5 · D7]
